      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "“財宝を求める者よ――\r\n次の史書を手がかりに、石像の火を順に灯せ。”",
        "official_en": "O, seekers of treasure, let these writings be your guide to light the statues.",
        "real_en": "\"Seekers of treasure—use the following chronicle as your guide and light the statues in order.\""
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
